1
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,500
See the hues in this one, Mara.

2
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,200
Aye, 'tis fair. Think it drifted from the deep?

3
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,100
The tide brings all things home, soon or late.

4
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,000
The sea's got a queer temper today, Elena.

5
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Just the winds turning, Nessa.

6
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Ma, help!

7
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:37,000
I've got ye! Keep clear of the drop!

8
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:12,000
The cliff paths are rotting, Petra. Sombody's bound to fall.

9
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:17,000
Some roads are best left to the sea, Elena.

10
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,000
Not when my girl's life is on the line.

11
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,000
Ye tie knots like a blind gull, Mara.

12
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Least I haul more fish than ye do.

13
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:24,000
Aye. That stings.

14
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:12,000
Ye shouldn't be here, Elena. The beacon only warns folks off.

15
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,000
Ye've kept eyes on us for years. Why?

16
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:22,000
Some knots can't be untied, no matter how deep the tide pulls.

17
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,000
The Watcher ain't no myth, Kade. I seen the shade meself.

18
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,000
Just tales to keep the little ones asleep.

19
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,000
What is this place?

20
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:32,000
These books... they hold my ma's name.
